                                                "sense_id": "48940233-b0be-30c1-be35-fc52a4eff38a",
                                                "text": "\"Did he always leave the sleepy in his eyes?\" \"Never removed it; let it build up in the comers of his eyes over the weeks until it was heavy enough to fall […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c87c13ab-0151-4de1-b828-c4b52a8971a1",
                                                "sense_id": "48940233-b0be-30c1-be35-fc52a4eff38a",
                                                "text": "But the nightdress was heavy, the sleepy in her eyes was heavy, her hair (she made a mustache of one of its locks) was heavy and smelled of cigarettes […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
